h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}},{"originalLink":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1688040/bc932f27-f854-4519-a92d-904f35f17619.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","categories":["kitchen"],"sizes":{"1024x768":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1688040/bc932f27-f854-4519-a92d-904f35f17619.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=768&w=1024","width":1024,"height":768},"2048x1536":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1688040/bc932f27-f854-4519-a92d-904f35f17619.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","width":2048,"height":1536},"320x240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1688040/bc932f27-f854-4519-a92d-904f35f17619.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1688040/bc932f27-f854-4519-a92d-904f35f17619.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1688040/bc932f27-f854-4519-a92d-904f35f17619.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}},{"originalLink":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1688040/92ac1973-6b4a-4d56-aef5-910b53e3e4cf.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","categories":["kitchen"],"sizes":{"1024x768":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1688040/92ac1973-6b4a-4d56-aef5-910b53e3e4cf.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=768&w=1024","width":1024,"height":768},"2048x1536":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1688040/92ac1973-6b4a-4d56-aef5-910b53e3e4cf.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","width":2048,"height":1536},"320x240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1688040/92ac1973-6b4a-4d56-aef5-910b53e3e4cf.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1688040/92ac1973-6b4a-4d56-aef5-910b53e3e4cf.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1688040/92ac1973-6b4a-4d56-aef5-910b53e3e4cf.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"(hidden): Grand Space | 6 Beds & Parking \n Where canals meet, your getaway begins. Central and ideal for groups. Welcome to your spacious home in the heart of Datteln..\n.\n.\n# Welcome.\n.\nThis spacious and fully equipped 79 m2 apartment is the perfect choice for guests seeking flexibility and a central location in the northern Ruhr area:.\n.\n- For Groups & Families: With a total of 6 single beds, the apartment offers ample space for larger families or travel groups. The balcony and generous layout ensure a relaxed atmosphere..\n.\n- For Business Travelers & Fitters: The layout features two separate bedrooms, each with three single beds and work areas (desk & chair), making this accommodation the ideal base for productive work and restful nights..\n.\n- For Clinic Visitors & Tourists: Thanks to the proximity to the \"Vestische Kinder- und Jugendklinik\" (Children's Clinic) and the Datteln bus station, you are perfectly connected. Discover the \"Dattelner Meer\" or use the apartment as a starting point for trips to the Haard forest..\n.\n.\n# The Apartment.\n.\nAcross a generous 79 m2, a bright and functional feel-good atmosphere unfolds on the 2nd floor. The apartment is accessible via the staircase. Each of the two bedrooms is designed as a private retreat, equipped with three comfortable single beds and seating options. The private balcony invites you to end the day relaxed in the fresh air..\n.\n.\n# Highlights.\n.\n- Unbeatable Connection: Only approx. 350 m from the Datteln bus station. The Children's Clinic and the city center are reachable within minutes..\n.\n- Space for 6 People: Maximum flexibility with 6 single beds, divided into two spacious bedrooms – ideal for guests who prefer separate sleeping arrangements..\n.\n- Free Parking: A private parking space directly at the house is available to you free of charge..\n.\n- Full Equipment: From a washing machine to a dishwasher, everything is provided for a completely independent stay..\n.\n.\n# Amenities.\n.\n- Living & Sleeping: Two separate bedrooms with three single beds each. Each room features a table with chairs for mobile work or private meals..\n.\n- Kitchen & Household: The fully equipped kitchen offers everything for effortless self-catering: A large, spacious refrigerator, ceramic hob, oven, dishwasher, and microwave are provided..\n.\n- Bath & Laundry: Functional bathroom with a shower. A private washing machine is available within the apartment for your laundry..\n.\n- Work & Internet: Stay connected with reliable Wi-Fi. The Smart TV offers the option to use your own streaming accounts or to connect your own mobile devices to the screen..\n.\n- Building & Access: Enjoy full flexibility for check-in thanks to modern smart locks (code access)..\n.\n.\n# About the Area.\n.\nYour strategic location: Situated between urban convenience, industrial culture, and top-tier medical care..\n.\n.\n# Location & Transportation.\n.\n- Public Transport: The central Datteln bus station is only about a 4-minute walk (350 m) away..\n.\n- Proximity to Clinic: The \"Vestische Kinder- und Jugendklinik Datteln\" is only approx. 1.1 km away (about 15 min walk or 3 min by car)..\n.\n- Parking: Your car is safe and free of charge on the private parking lot directly at the property..\n.\n- City Center: The pedestrian zone with various shopping opportunities is reachable in about 10 minutes on foot..\n.\n.\n# Your Quick Route to Destinations:.\n.\n- Destination: Children's Clinic | Transport: On foot / Car | Duration: approx. 15 / 3 min..\n.\n- Destination: City Center / Shopping | Transport: On foot | Duration: approx. 10 minutes.\n.\n- Destination: Dattelner Meer (Canal Hub) | Transport: On foot / Bike | Duration: approx. 20 / 5 min..\n.\n- Destination: Recklinghausen Center | Transport: Bus SB24 | Duration: approx. 20 minutes.\n.\n.\n# Shopping & Daily Needs.\n.\nEverything for your daily needs is within walking distance: several supermarkets, bakeries, and drugstores are reachable within 5 to 10 minutes on foot. The central downtown area also offers everything for an extensive shopping trip..\n.\n.\n# Dining & Going Out.\n.\nDatteln offers a diverse gastronomic scene. Whether it’s the excellent \"Hafenrestaurant\" with a view of the water or the first-class steakhouse \"Am Alten Markt\" – there is something for every taste..\n.\n.\n# Leisure & Relaxation.\n.\nDatteln is the point where four canals meet. A paradise for walkers and cyclists:.\n.\n- Henrichenburg Boat Lift: An impressive industrial monument in the immediate vicinity..\n.\n- Die Haard: One of the largest contiguous forest areas in the Ruhr region – ideal for hiking and relaxing..\n.\n- Dattelner Meer: Watch the shipping traffic at the world's largest canal junction..\n.\n.\n# Host's Insider Tips.\n.\n- Insider Tip 1 (Maritime): Visit the Hafenrestaurant Datteln. Enjoy excellent cuisine on the terrace with a direct view of the canal – a true holiday feeling..\n.\n- Insider Tip 2 (Industrial Culture): A trip to the Henrichenburg Boat Lift is a must. The historic structure is an impressive photo motif and a technical marvel..\n.\n- Insider Tip 3 (Pure Nature): Take a walk along the Alte Fahrt. These decommissioned canal sections are now idyllic biotopes and offer absolute tranquility..\n.\n- Insider Tip 4 (Historic): Visit Schloss Horneburg. The charming complex on the outskirts of Datteln provides a great backdrop for an afternoon stroll..\n.\n- Insider Tip 5 (The View): Take a detour to Löringhof. From there, you have a wonderful view over the canal landscape and can enjoy the vastness of the region..\n.\n.\n# Important Notes on Accommodation & Location.\n.\nThe apartment is located on the 2nd floor and is accessible exclusively via the staircase (no elevator)..\n.\nThe house is centrally located yet in a pleasant residential environment, allowing you to reach all important points of the city easily on foot..\n.\nPlease note that pets are not allowed in this accommodation..\n.\n.\n.\nReady for your stay at the canal hub? Whether for work, family, or a clinic visit – book your spacious (hidden) in Datteln now!","facilities":{"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"2"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"no"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"no"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"private"},"smoking":{"value":"no"},"totalSize":{"value":"79"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"no"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":270000,"deposit":20000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"2700.00","deposit":"200.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":0,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":2,"minAge":0,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"2027-10-15","from":"2026-06-01"},{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2029-04-23"}],"updated":"2026-04-23T02:12:14Z","__utId__":"ut1688040"}]